# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Vercel Hobby / free-tier deploy limit workaround
# Ship the static web app + small download assets only.
# Large installers live on GitHub Releases — do not upload to Vercel.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Local build trees
node_modules
**/node_modules
android-app/build
android-app/.tmp-gradle-build
android-app/dist
android-app
desktop/dist
desktop/node_modules
desktop/app
desktop
scratch
scratch-*
codearc-restrosuite
codearc-restrosuite-1
backups
.git
test-results
uploads
gateway-hf
gateway-tray
local-builds
publish-static

# Oversized binaries — DO NOT upload to Vercel hobby
downloads/**/*.exe
downloads/**/*.exe.blockmap
downloads/**/*.dmg
downloads/**/*.zip
# Keep downloads/desktop/*.yml (electron-updater feed). Only skip fat binaries:
downloads/desktop/**/*.exe
downloads/desktop/**/*.exe.blockmap
downloads/desktop/**/*.dmg
downloads/desktop/**/*.zip
*.exe
*.dmg
*.blockmap
*.apk

# Heavy PDF guides can stay under ~11MB each; if deploy still fails, ignore:
# downloads/*.pdf
